WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.185 line:88% align:center
Welcome to Roadmap Builder.

2
00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:05.092 line:88% align:center
It puts your whole programme into one intuitive,

3
00:00:05.142 --> 00:00:08.967 line:88% align:center
interactive view, and this short guide shows you how to read it.

4
00:00:10.633 --> 00:00:13.507 line:88% align:center
Start by pointing at anything on the chart.

5
00:00:13.557 --> 00:00:14.799 line:88% align:center
A bar, a milestone,

6
00:00:14.849 --> 00:00:19.490 line:88% align:center
or a stage on the critical path will show a small card with its dates

7
00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:20.238 line:88% align:center
and a note.

8
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.766 line:88% align:center
The card stays where it opened, so you can reach it.

9
00:00:23.816 --> 00:00:25.986 line:88% align:center
Pick it up and put it wherever suits you,

10
00:00:26.036 --> 00:00:27.665 line:88% align:center
and it will keep opening there.

11
00:00:28.433 --> 00:00:30.997 line:88% align:center
When you want the full story, click the item.

12
00:00:31.047 --> 00:00:34.599 line:88% align:center
A dialog opens with everything that has been written about it.

13
00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:37.401 line:88% align:center
Long programmes run off the screen,

14
00:00:37.451 --> 00:00:39.486 line:88% align:center
so the schedule scrolls on its own.

15
00:00:39.536 --> 00:00:41.928 line:88% align:center
The years and the headings stay in place,

16
00:00:41.978 --> 00:00:43.834 line:88% align:center
so you never lose your bearings.

17
00:00:44.567 --> 00:00:46.460 line:88% align:center
As you move across the timeline,

18
00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:49.679 line:88% align:center
a faint line shows the exact date under your pointer.

19
00:00:49.729 --> 00:00:51.501 line:88% align:center
And if the names feel cramped,

20
00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:55.146 line:88% align:center
drag the edge of the activity column to give them more room.

21
00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:57.545 line:88% align:center
To zoom, drag the year scale

22
00:00:57.595 --> 00:01:00.147 line:88% align:center
and the timeline stretches under your hand.

23
00:01:00.197 --> 00:01:03.053 line:88% align:center
Or right-click a row and fit the timeline to it,

24
00:01:03.103 --> 00:01:05.655 line:88% align:center
so that row fills the middle of the screen.

25
00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.041 line:88% align:center
There is also a quick way to find anything.

26
00:01:09.091 --> 00:01:12.920 line:88% align:center
Press Control K, type a word or two, and choose from the list.

27
00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:14.547 line:88% align:center
Here it takes us to today.

28
00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.913 line:88% align:center
If you ever need a reminder,

29
00:01:16.963 --> 00:01:20.537 line:88% align:center
the Guide button at the end of the toolbar opens these steps,

30
00:01:20.587 --> 00:01:22.200 line:88% align:center
with the videos beside them.

31
00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.933 line:88% align:center
The version you are using is shown next to it.

